      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can frame the vote as supporting the *community center's mission* while challenging the *specific funding mechanism* proposed in that bill. The message should be that you support vital local resources but believe the allocation method or cost was inefficient or mismanaged. This pivots the critique from \"anti-community\" to \"pro-effective governance,\" positioning the candidate as a diligent steward of public funds.",
